  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Uniqueness of the point\n\nθ_A = d, θ_F = 0 with **d and u symbolic**. Every entry of [H_MZ, t̄_a(u)] is a polynomial in u and d; the commutator vanishes for all u iff d is a common root of all its u-coefficients. Show the gcd of these polynomials in d.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Clear[d];\ndRoots[a_] := Module[{C = H4 . tb[a][types4, {d, 0, d, 0}, u] - tb[a][types4, {d, 0, d, 0}, u] . H4, polys},\n   polys = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[CoefficientList[#, u] & /@ Union[Expand[C[\"NonzeroValues\"]]]]], 0];\n   {Length[polys], Factor[PolynomialGCD @@ polys]}];\ndRows = Table[Prepend[dRoots[a], \"t̄\" <> ToString[a]], {a, 3}];\nGrid[Prepend[dRows, {\"\", \"# distinct u-coefficient polynomials in d\", \"their gcd (common roots = allowed d)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"33\" data-out-n=\"390\" data-sub-idx=\"3\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"5\" data-sub-end=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[390]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.9202em;vertical-align:-2.1901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7301em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.6901em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.6901em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8802em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.1901em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.6901em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.8501em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">t</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1841em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span c