   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. H_MZ from the transfer matrices\n\nU(u) = t̄₁(θ_F + u) · t̄₃(θ_A − h + u). At u = 0, t̄₁ has P on all F sites and t̄₃ has P on all A sites; the A–F dressings (−(θ_A−θ_F) + hK)(θ_A−θ_F−4h + hK) are both −2h + hK at the ABJM point, and (−2h + hK)² = 4h² (K² = 4K). So U(0) = c·S (translation by one pair) and H_MZ should be α U(0)⁻¹U′(0) + β (L = 2 pairs, exact).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Uu = Normal[t1M[types4, thABJM, thABJM[[2]] + u] . t3M[types4, thABJM, thABJM[[1]] - hh + u]];\nU0 = SparseArray[Expand[Uu /. u -> 0]]; c0 = Tr[U0 . Transpose[S4]]/nn^4;\ndU = SparseArray[Expand[D[Uu, u] /. u -> 0]];\nHU = Transpose[S4] . dU/c0;\nId256 = IdentityMatrix[nn^4, SparseArray];\n{alpha, beta} = LeastSquares[Transpose[{Flatten[Normal[HU]], Flatten[Normal[Id256]]}], Flatten[Normal[H4]]];\nGrid[{{\"U(0) = c S\", zeroQ[U0 - c0 S4]}, {\"c\", c0},\n  {\"H_MZ = α U(0)⁻¹U′(0) + β  (exact)\", zeroQ[H4 - alpha HU - beta Id256]}, {\"α\", alpha}, {\"β\", beta}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"36\" data-out-n=\"413\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"9\" data-sub-start=\"6\" data-sub-end=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[413]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"wolfbook-render-error\" style=\"color:#cc0000;font-family:monospace;white-space:pre-wrap\">[LaTeX error] KaTeX parse error: Expected &#39;EOF&#39;, got &#39;^&#39; at position 129: …\\alpha$ U(0)⁻¹U^̲{\\prime}(0) + $…<br><small>\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{U(0) = c S} &amp; \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{c} &amp; \\frac{1}{16}\\\\\\hline\\text{H\\_MZ = $\\alpha$ U(0)⁻¹U^{\\prime}(0) + $\\beta$  (exact)} &amp; \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\alpha  &amp; 1\\\\\\hline\\beta  &amp; 12\\\\\\hline\\end{array}</small></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[413]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{U(0) = c S} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{c} & \\frac{1}{16}\\\\\\hline\\text{H\\_MZ = $\\alpha$ U(0)⁻¹U^{\\prime}(0) + $\\beta$  (exact)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\alpha  & 1\\\\\\hline\\beta  & 12\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "08e39dd2-168f-4593-9076-dc3ffc6d3fd5"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. L = 3 pairs (4096-dim), numerical\n\nOne-pass vector form of t̄₁, t̄₂, t̄₃ (as in `dual-lax-t3.wb`), H_MZ as a sparse matrix; relative residual ‖[H_MZ, t̄_a(u)]ψ‖/‖t̄_aψ‖ on a random ψ for θ_A − θ_F ∈ {2h, 0, 0.3}.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "applySite[psi_, s_, m_, L_] := Flatten[Map[m . # &, ArrayReshape[psi, {nn^(s - 1), nn, nn^(L - s)}]]];\ntransferV[lax_, types_, ths_, v_, psi_, dA_] := Module[{L = Length[types], Phi, mat},\n   mat[s_, i_, j_] := N[Normal[lax[types[[s]]][v, ths[[s]]][i, j]]];\n   Phi = Table[applySite[psi, L, mat[L, k, j], L], {k, dA}, {j, dA}];\n   Do[Phi = Table[Sum[applySite[Phi[[m, j]], s, mat[s, k, m], L], {m, dA}], {k, dA}, {j, dA}], {s, L - 1, 1, -1}];\n   Sum[Phi[[i, i]], {i, dA}]];\ntypes6 = {\"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\", \"A\", \"F\"};\nH6 = N[HMZ[6]];\nSeedRandom[1]; psi6 = RandomReal[{-1, 1}, nn^6];\nlaxOf = <|1 -> {lax1, 4}, 2 -> {lax2, 6}, 3 -> {lax3, 4}|>;\ncomm6[a_, dd_] := With[{ths = Flatten[Table[{dd, 0}, 3]], lx = laxOf[a][[1]], dA = laxOf[a][[2]]},\n   With[{tpsi = transferV[lx, types6, ths, 0.37, psi6, dA]},\n    Norm[H6 . tpsi - transferV[lx, types6, ths, 0.37, H6 . psi6, dA]]/Norm[tpsi]]];\ncomm6Rows = Table[{\"t̄\" <> ToString[a], ScientificForm[comm6[a, 2 hh], 2], ScientificForm[comm6[a, 0], 2], ScientificForm[comm6[a, 0.3], 2]}, {a, 3}];\nGrid[Prepend[comm6Rows, {\"L = 3 pairs\", \"θ_A − θ_F = 2h\", \"= 0\", \"= 0.3\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
